# The bobber in the client (docs/design/fish-and-fishing.md 4.2, Phase D): a
# secondary press with the rod casts, the bobber lands on the water and floats,
# and another secondary press reels it in. Same lake as fish.input.

case a cast bobber floats on the water and a reel clears it
start walk stream at 20.5 122.5
click
lock
frame 50 x40
held tool:fishing_rod
# look down about 0.5 rad so the cast lands in the lake, not on the far shore
mouse 0 200
expect bobber = none
button down right
frame 50
button up right
frame 50
expect event line_cast
expect bobber = flying
until bobber = floating
expect bobber != none
expect bobber.near 0 0 0 1 = 0
button down right
frame 50
button up right
frame 50 x2
expect bobber = none
